    ['leopard-vs-tiger-vs-cheetah-vs-jaguar-how-to-tell-apart', 'Leopard vs Tiger vs Cheetah vs Jaguar: How to Tell Them Apart', 'Wildlife', 'jawai-leopard-rest',
     'A quick, practical guide to the big cats’ patterns, builds and habitats, for safari beginners.',
