    ['responsible-wildlife-tourism-tips-for-india', 'Responsible Wildlife Tourism: 12 Tips for Your Next Safari in India', 'Wildlife', 'jawai-leopard-temple',
     'Small choices on safari protect animals and villages. Here are twelve you can start with.',
