    ['best-camera-lens-and-settings-for-jawai-safari', 'Best Camera, Lens and Settings for a Jawai Safari', 'Photography', 'jawai-leopard-stride',
     'A practical kit and settings guide for leopards, birds and landscapes in open jeeps.',
