    ['mobile-phone-wildlife-photography-on-safari', 'Mobile Phone Wildlife Photography on Safari: Simple Tips That Work', 'Photography', 'jawai-peafowl',
     'You do not need a big camera. Here is how to get usable wildlife photos on your phone.',
