    ['jawai-for-foreign-tourists-and-nri-guide', 'Jawai for Foreign Tourists and NRIs: Documents, Money and Practical Tips', 'Planning', 'jawai-hills-view',
     'Visiting from abroad? Here is what to prepare for a smooth Jawai stay.',
     'Jawai for Foreign Tourists and NRIs: Documents, Money and Tips',
     'Practical help for foreign tourists and NRIs visiting Jawai: passports and visas at check-in, money and exchange, SIM cards, plugs, food, tipping and etiquette.',
