    ['what-if-weather-turns-rain-fog-and-cold-on-safari', 'What If the Weather Turns? Rain, Fog and Cold on a Jawai Safari', 'Seasons', 'jawai-lake-birds',
     'Weather can change a drive. Here is how to prepare and what happens if conditions are poor.',
     'Rain, Fog and Cold on a Jawai Safari: What If the Weather Turns?',
     'What happens if weather turns on a Jawai safari: rain, fog, cold mornings and heat. How to dress, what safaris do, and how to reschedule.',
