     'Weather is part of any wildlife trip. A calm plan and flexible expectations make it far easier.',
     [['Rain', 'Light rain is fine with a poncho. Heavy rain can make some tracks muddy, so routes may change or a drive may be postponed. Cover cameras and phones.'],
      ['Fog and cold', 'Winter mornings can have fog and sharp cold. Visibility may be limited at first light and improves as the sun rises. Dress in layers, with a woollen cap and gloves.'],
      ['Heat', 'Summer afternoons are hot. Drives are timed for cooler hours. Carry water and wear a hat.'],
      ['If a drive is affected', 'We will tell you honestly and suggest alternatives, such as shifting the time or the next drive. Keep one spare drive in your plan. See [seasons guide](blog/best-time-to-visit-jawai).']],
     [['Will I get a refund if the safari is cancelled for weather?', 'Terms are agreed when a booking is confirmed. We try to reschedule where possible.'],
      ['Can I do a safari in light rain?', 'Often yes, with proper rain cover.'],
      ['Does fog affect sightings?', 'It can reduce visibility early on, but it often clears quickly.']], 'safari'],

    ['second-visit-to-jawai-how-to-do-it-differently', 'A Second Visit to Jawai: How to Do It Differently', 'Planning', 'jawai-leopard-boulder',
     'Seen the leopards once? Here are ways to make a return trip feel fresh.',
     'A Second Visit to Jawai: Do Something New on Your Return Trip',
     'Ideas for a repeat visit to Jawai: change the season, focus on birds or photography, try a full-day expedition, stay longer and explore nearby places.',
     'return visit Jawai, second trip Jawai, repeat Jawai safari, Jawai in a different season, Jawai new experiences',
     'Jawai changes with the seasons, the light and your own focus. A second trip rarely repeats the first.',
     [['Change the season', 'If you came in winter, try the green monsoon or the hot, sightings-rich summer. See [Jawai in summer](blog/jawai-in-summer-april-june-leopard-sightings) and [monsoon](blog/jawai-in-monsoon-july-september).'],
      ['Change the focus', '- Go birding at the dam. || - Join a photography drive. || - Spend a day on a longer expedition. || - Add stargazing and a village walk.'],
