    ['jawai-faq-25-questions-answered', 'Jawai FAQ: 25 Questions Travellers Ask, Answered', 'Planning', 'jawai-leopard-padma',
     'The quick answers to the most common questions about safaris, stays, seasons and getting to Bera.',
     'Jawai FAQ: 25 Common Questions About Leopard Safari and Stay',
     'Answers to 25 frequent Jawai questions: safari booking, timing, sightings, kids, food, weather, distances, clothing, photography and safety.',
     'Jawai FAQ, Jawai safari questions, Jawai travel questions, Jawai leopard safari FAQ, questions about Jawai Bera',
     'These are the questions we hear most. Short answers here, with links when you want more detail.',
     [['Safari', '- Will I see a leopard? Many guests do, but sightings are never guaranteed. See the [complete guide](blog/jawai-leopard-safari-complete-guide). || - How long is a drive? About three hours. || - What time do drives start? Around first light and about 4:00 PM, depending on the season. || - Is it private? Yes, private open jeeps up to about six guests. || - How many drives should I book? Three or four.'],
      ['Planning', '- Best time to visit? Winter is the most comfortable and summer is strong for sightings. See [best time to visit](blog/best-time-to-visit-jawai). || - How many nights? Two minimum, three ideal. || - How do I get there? Drive from Udaipur or Jodhpur, or take a train to Sumerpur or Falna plus a taxi. See [how to reach Jawai](blog/how-to-reach-jawai-from-udaipur-jodhpur-jaipur). || - When should I book? Two to three weeks ahead, earlier for holidays. || - Do you take online payment? No, we confirm by call or WhatsApp.'],
      ['Comfort', '- What should I wear? Neutral colours and layers. See [what to pack](blog/what-to-pack-for-jawai-safari). || - Is it safe? Yes, if you follow the rules. See [is Jawai safe](blog/is-jawai-safe-for-tourists-safety-tips). || - Is it suitable for kids and seniors? Yes, at a gentle pace. || - Is there Wi-Fi? Yes, at the hotel. || - Is the food vegetarian? Yes, 100% vegetarian.'],
      ['Extras', '- Can I do a day trip to Ranakpur? Yes, about 48 km away. || - Can I take a drone? Usually not. || - Can I photograph the Rabari? Ask first. || - Are there ATMs? In nearby towns, not always in the village.']],
     [['Where is Jawai?', 'In Pali district, Rajasthan, roughly between Udaipur and Jodhpur. Bera is the village base.'],
      ['Is it a national park?', 'No, it is a leopard conservation reserve with villages and farms.'],
      ['Who do I contact to plan my trip?', 'Message us on WhatsApp or use the contact page. See [contact](contact).']], 'plan'],
